        "locator": "L195-L219 (Migration Guide: From v2 to v3 › Static configuration › Consul provider › TLS.CAOptional)",
        "excerpt": "#### TLS.CAOptional\n\nConsul provider `tls.CAOptional` option has been removed in v3, as TLS client authentication is a server side option (see https://pkg.go.dev/crypto/tls#ClientAuthType).\n\n??? example \"An example usage of the TLS.CAOptional option\"\n\n    ```yaml tab=\"File (YAML)\"\n    providers:\n      consul:\n        tls: \n          caOptional: true\n    ```\n\n    ```toml tab=\"File (TOML)\"\n    [providers.consul.tls]\n        caOptional=true\n    ```\n\n    ```bash tab=\"CLI\"\n    --providers.consul.tls.caOptional=true\n    ```\n\n##### Remediation\n\nThe `tls.caOptional` option should be removed from the C…",
